{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2023-02-01 12:55:00', 'title': "FOR THE SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, TYSON FOODS TOPS FORTUNE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES LIST FOR FOOD PRODUCTION", 'text': "SPRINGDALE, ARK., FEB. 01, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TYSON FOODS, INC. (NYSE: TSN) RANKS NO. 1 ON FORTUNE MAGAZINE'S LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES IN THE FOOD PRODUCTION CATEGORY FOR THE SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR."}